@hy-sde-org/dsh-web-search-public README · Prerequisites：- Node.js 22.19 or newer with npm and pnpm on `PATH`;
- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.0-rc.2` including the standard `dsh` CLI;
- no API keys — nothing else.

Install the Harness CLI and pnpm before continuing:

```bash
npm install --global @deepseek-ai/dsh@0.2.0-rc.2 pnpm
dsh --version
```

@hy-sde-org/dsh-web-search-public README · Route A — published npm package (recommended)：```bash
dsh plugin --profile web add @hy-sde-org/dsh-web-search-public
```

@hy-sde-org/dsh-web-search-public README · Browser escalation (bot walls)：Escalation is optional: mount the `browser` service row **before** this provider and the
browser-backed engines light up; without it they stay fetch-only (original behavior), and
`timeoutMs` (default 30 s) is the per-engine budget that covers fetch → browser steps.
